WEBVTT

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.690
Um, I...

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.680
You were with him in the end.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.930
Thanks.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.920
Death is not the end of the Heroic Blood.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.800
They simply transform into red stones.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:41.720
Chaos controls the Heroic Blood
and makes them fight each other

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:44.410
in the hope that they'll destroy one another.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.860
The extinction of Heroic Blood...

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.570
Once all the Heroic Blood is gone,
the world will be destroyed.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.320
We must destroy Tokyo soon.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:01.700
Only one of the Heroic Blood can survive.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:07.600
They shall become the Lord of Vermilion
and the foundation of the new world.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:13.800
Only one.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.360
I shall become the foundation of the new world.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.020
Please Join Our Hands With the Holy Words

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:09.490
He could be the Lord of Vermilion.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.400
Can I beat him?

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.600
Inuki...

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:46.770
We did it.

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:49.830
One of the Heroic Blood has
disappeared from this world.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:54.610
It sure took you long enough.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:58.740
We're making the final
adjustments to the experiment.

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:03.090
The day of the Second Great Collapse is soon.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.700
And to do that...

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:12.060
Naturally, we'll have to pay
with even more human lives.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.050
But...

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:16.640
We should continue killing
the enemy Heroic Blood.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:21.190
If they interfere, we won't
have time for the experiment.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.520
You're right.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:27.810
They're weakened right now.
Ain't this a good time to strike?

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:30.030
Right, newbie?

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.950
Yeah, of course.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.860
Do you agree, Yuri?

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:41.960
Yes.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.440
Very well.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.990
Then kill them.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.960
Death to the Heroic Blood. For me.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.980
Jun-san, I'll do my best!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.730
What should we do? Who should we kill first?

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.070
We'll start with Kamina Chihiro.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.230
But we won't just kill him.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.510
He took my brother from me.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:10.130
We'll inflict the same suffering on him
and kill him on the brink of despair.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:12.380
You stay out of this.

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:13.140
What?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.910
Your personal feelings will get in our way.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.360
Haru and I will handle this.

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:23.260
Let's go, Haru.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.090
Yes, sir!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.760
Inuki-san...

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.690
If you want to.

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.900
Show me the future you'll create.

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:48.900
Can someone like me be like Inuki-san?

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:02.420
Shiraki-san?

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.400
Thank goodness.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.110
I—

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:27.470
Chihiro-kun, go ahead.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.540
Shiraki-san, you can start.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:48.620
I'm glad I got to see you again.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:06:59.980
For no particular reason...

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:05.160
Really, for no reason at all,
coming here calms me.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.110
Me, too.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:11.950
I come here whenever I want to think alone.

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:16.270
Today I wanted to see you, though.

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.270
Shiraki-san...

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:20.220
Here.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:25.100
I've been trying to recreate that flavor.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:27.770
Well?

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:32.930
It's good.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:35.650
I-It's not good enough yet.

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:41.450
The one your mother made had
a gentle, more calming flavor.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.110
Mom.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.180
"It's all because of your mother."

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:49.880
Huh?

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.470
It's what you said before.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.780
What does it mean?

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.920
Well...

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:01.480
I want to know.

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:13.790
Your mother... Professor Mitsuki
and my father worked together.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.190
What?

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:20.300
During the accident 13 years ago,

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.390
we were here.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:32.160
I don't know exactly what kind of
experiment they were performing,

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.770
but it failed.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:39.020
Your mother was swallowed up by another world.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.290
Everything as we knew it changed.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:51.650
My kind father stopped looking at me.

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:58.640
It's also when he started using
Tokyo to open gates to other worlds.

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:04.490
You stopped coming here, too.

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:07.420
I wanted to look for you,
but my father wouldn't let me.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:14.920
I learned about your father
only recently. I was lonely.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.360
I missed you.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:23.660
But I had no choice but to live
as my father wanted.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:28.070
It was the only place I belonged anymore.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:33.460
But my father only saw me as
Shiraki Yuri, vessel of Heroic Blood.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.680
Not as Yuri, his daughter.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:40.060
He forced me to fight as
a vessel of Heroic Blood.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:43.750
Though we were finally reunited,
I was forced to try to kill you.

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.680
I wondered how this came to be.

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:50.310
Why?

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:53.070
So I...

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:57.930
I'm sorry.

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:03.790
Thanks. I feel a little better.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:17.300
Thanks for the hot cocoa.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:20.800
Sure.

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:35.270
Inuki-san... Mom...

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:39.240
Shiraki-san...

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:50.370
Kotetsu!

00:10:54.810 --> 00:10:57.410
No. Kotetsu can't die.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.610
Never!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.600
I should be able to do it.

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.270
I have to fight it.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.020
I won't be swept away by fate.

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:15.520
Kotetsu!

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:22.030
Domyoji Dojo

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.690
Hey, Tsubaki-chan.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:29.980
I sure am glad you weren't busy!

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.290
Huh? I can't hear you.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:39.340
Ignoring the fact that you saved me
wouldn't be very honorable.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.040
What? We're going where?

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.380
Let's ride.

00:11:44.380 --> 00:11:46.010
I said, I can't hear—

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:53.730
Life and death are two faces of the same coin

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:54.980
Domyoji Dojo

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:56.940
Kotetsu.,,

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.270
Wow.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:09.450
This is Tokyo now, but you can't
see this from the outside.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:13.320
This is number eight of my favorite spots.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.620
You have lots of others?

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.280
Yeah. I'll show them to you.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:22.380
There's lots of other places
I wanna check out with you.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.750
I'm hungry.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.410
Let's get a bite to eat, then!

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:43.430
What should I do?

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:47.660
What can I do for Kotetsu?

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:54.480
Father.

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:58.400
Good. You're still here.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.780
Chihiro-kun...

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:03.450
I missed you.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:14.270
Jun-san, I'm hungry.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:19.920
Why do we have to watch them flirt?

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.970
Let's just kidnap him already.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.990
The Guardian State girl.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:29.210
She's in the way right now.

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:31.050
We'll have to kill her.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.440
A dream?

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:37.370
Yeah. I don't understand it, either.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.530
But in those red dreams,

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:44.400
the important people in my life
died one after another.

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:50.050
First it was Kotetsu's dad, then Inuki-san.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:53.680
And just as my dreams predicted,

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.480
they died.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.910
So they're prophetic dreams?

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.080
This time it was Kotetsu.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.200
He's like a brother to me.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:13.090
It's silly to be controlled by my dreams.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:17.330
But I feel like they're more than just dreams.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:21.740
Not that anyone would take me seriously.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.710
Why are you telling me?

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:31.970
Because you told me all those things
after we escaped the barrier together.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.840
And because you're you, I guess.

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:38.930
Chihiro-kun.

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:45.250
Even if it's fate and can't be
overturned, I still want to try.

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.770
Otherwise, Kotetsu will...

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:52.900
I...

00:14:55.700 --> 00:15:00.210
I think you can fight back against anything.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:08.050
As long as you have the courage to try,
I'm sure you can change something.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.200
That's what I want to believe.

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.250
Shiraki-san...

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:16.810
If you know something, will you tell me?

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.640
Sorry. That was a weird question to ask.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.690
Listen, I...

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.720
Chihiro-san! Help!

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:34.890
Kotetsu?!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.540
Total

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.250
You saved us.

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.990
Thanks for treating us.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:55.640
Sorry. I can't believe both
of us forgot our wallets.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.530
Worst mistake of my life.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.340
I was really worried.

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:07.820
Receiving the check without any
money on you is mega scary!

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.070
I said I was sorry for exaggerating.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.070
A-Are you mad?

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:16.810
I'm glad you're okay.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:20.580
Come on, Chihiro-san.
You don't need to act so serious.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.670
Seriously?

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:25.120
Now that he's here, our plan is ruined.

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:29.110
J-Jun-san?

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:31.590
It's too bad.

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:34.540
I planned to take my time,

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:39.350
but I'm just not patient enough, Kamina Chihiro.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.730
I'll tear you apart.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:45.850
You handle the woman. Got it?

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:48.330
Okay, sir.

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.570
Chihiro-san, I'm really sorry!

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.610
You...

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.240
Kotetsu!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.240
Kotecchan!

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:57.840
Hold it!

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.560
You've got me to deal with!

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.430
Kamina Chihiro, come!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.000
I'll show you true Hell!

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.410
Don't underestimate me, brat.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.480
You may be a woman, but I won't hold back!

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:22.930
I'll crush you!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:27.770
Akira wouldn't want me to, but it looks
like I'll have to shut you down.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.370
Densuke!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.350
Kotetsu!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:56.880
Stop!

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.350
Chihiro-san...

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:07.980
Don't move!

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.410
If you resist, I'll pierce his heart.

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:25.700
Hurts, doesn't it? Isn't it painful?

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:29.500
But this isn't enough for me to forgive you.

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:41.640
He suffered that death, all for this man.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:45.140
There was no need for him to hasten his end.

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.930
He should've met a respectable end.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:50.400
Unlike me, he was...

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.770
"He"? Inuki-san?

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.450
It's your fault!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:57.150
You killed Inuki with your selfish power!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.600
No! I was trying to save Inuki-san!

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:05.990
You don't even deserve to speak Inuki's name!

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:14.110
Kotetsu!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.290
Shiraki-san?

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:27.890
Yuri. What do you think you're doing?

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:35.570
Shiraki Yuri.

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:37.190
Don't be ridiculous!

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:39.640
I'm sorry.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.770
Shiraki-san!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.430
You're tougher than I expected.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.300
But it's over now!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.380
Oh?

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:53.110
Kotecchan!

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.140
Kotetsu.

00:20:56.140 --> 00:20:58.730
Chihiro-san.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.090
You're okay now.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:07.410
Thank you, Shiraki-san.

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:10.770
I decided I'd help you,

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:14.070
no matter what I had to face.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:18.670
But now you have nowhere to return to.

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:23.270
That's fine.

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.760
You saved me and Kotetsu.

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.440
This time I'll save you.

00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:33.020
So...

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:38.330
Will you come with me, Yuri?
